---
description: How to work in a site exported from Hlou
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before any change and follow it. Pages,
content and theme are written in `hlou/site/**` (the spec), then checked with
`pnpm hlou:compile`. Never edit `site/**`, `hlou/site.lock.json`,
`package.json` or `next.config.*`. New code goes in `custom/**` and
`app/(custom)/**`; a block's markup changes only through a `codeVariant` branch.
Topic notes: `.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md`.
